hadiths[162]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6526","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein khutba dene ke liye khadey huey aur farmaya ''tum log qiyamat ke din is haal mein jama kiye jaogey ke nangey paon aur nangey jism hogey. jaisa ke Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ''jis tarah ham ne shuru mein paida kya tha isi tarah lota dengey. '' aur tamam makhlooqat mein sabse pahley jisey kapda pahnaayaa jaeyga wo Ibrahim hongey aur meri ummat ke bahut se log laey jaeinge jinke aamaal naamey baaein hath mein hongey. main is par kahunga : aey mere rab! ye to mere sathi hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kya naii-naii bad-duaa nikaalii thin. us waqt main bhi wahi kahunga jo nek bandey (Eisaa (Alaihissalam) ( ne kaha ( وكنت عليهم شهيدا ما دمت فيهم‏ (ke '' ya Allah ! main jab tak unmein maujood raha us waqt tak mein un par gawah tha.'' Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke Farishtey ( mujh se) kahengey ke ye log hamesha apni eidiyon ke bal phirtey hi rahe (murtad hotey rahe ( ."
"6527","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum nangey paaun, nangey jism, bila khatna ke uthaey jaogey. ''Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) farmati hain ke is par maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! to kya mard auratein aik doosrey ko dekhtey hongey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us waqt mamla us se kahin zyada sakht hoga, iska khayal bhi koi nahi kar sakega."
"6528","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik kheme mein they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka aik chothai raho ? ham ne kaha ke ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka tum aik tehai raho ? ham ne kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka tum aadhey raho? ham ne kaha ji haan. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai, mujhey ummeed hai ke tum log ( ummat Muslima ( ahle-jannat ka hissa hogey aur aisa isliye hoga ke jannat mein farmaanbardaar nafs ke ilawa aur koi dakhil na hoga aur tum log shirk karne walon ke darmyan ( tadaad mein) is tarah hogey jaisey siyah bail ke jism par safaid baal hotey hain ya jaisey surkh ke jism par aik siyah baal ho."
"6529","qiyamat ke din sabse pahley Adam (Alaihissalam) ko pukara jaeyga phir unki nasl unko dekhegii to kaha jaeyga ke ye tumharey buzurg dada Adam hain. ( pukarney par) wo kahengey ke labbaik w sa'daik . Allah Taala farmaeyga ke apni nasl mein se dozakh ka hissa nikaal lo. Adam (Alaihissalam) arz karengey aey parwardigar ! kitnon ko nikaalun ? Allah Taala farmaeyga feesad ( ninyaanwe feesad dozakhi aik jannati ( . sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! jab ham mein so mein ninyaanwe nikal diye jayen to phir baqi kya reh jaeinge ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tamam ummaton mein meri ummat itni hi tadaad mein hogi jaisey siyah bail ke jism par safaid baal hotey hain."
"6530","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmaeyga, aey Adam ! Adam (Alaihissalam) kahengey hazir hun, farmaan- bardaar hun aur har bhalai terey hath mein hai. Allah Taala farmaeyga jo log jahannam mein daley jaeinge unhein nikaal lo. Adam (Alaihissalam) poochhein gey jahannam mein daley janey waley log kitney hain? Allah Taala farmaeyga ke har aik hazaar mein se nau (9) sou ninyaanwe . yahi wo waqt hoga jab bachchey gham se boodhey ho jaeinge aur haamla auratein apna hamal gira dein gii aur tum logon ko nashey ki haalat mein dekhogey, halanke wo waqei nashey ki haalat mein na hongey balke Allah ka azab sakht hoga. sahaba ko ye baat bahut sakht malum hui to unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! phir ham mein se wo (khush naseeb) shakhs kon hoga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen khushkhabri ho, aik hazaar yaajooj maajooj ki qaum se hongey aur tum mein se wo aik jannati hoga phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhey ummeed hai ke tum log ahle-jannat ka aik tehai hissey hogey . rawi ne bayan kya ke ham ne is par Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur uski takbeer kahi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai mujhey ummeed hai ke aadha hissey ahle-jannat ka tum log ho gey. tumhari misal dusri ummaton ke muqaabley mein aisi hai jaisey kisi siyah bail ke jism par safaid baalon ki (ma'moolii ta'daad) hoti hai ya wo safaid dagh jo gadhey ke aagey ke paon par hota hai."
"6531","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( يوم يقوم Naas لرب العالمين‏ ( ki tafseer mein farmaya ke tum mein se har koi sarey jahaanon ke parwardigar ke aagey khada hoga is haal mein ke uska paseena kanon ki lo tak pahuncha hua hoga."
"6532","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din log pasiney mein sharaabor ho jaeinge aur haalat ye ho jaeygi ke tum mein se har kisi ka paseena zameen par 70 hath tak phail jaeyga aur munh tak pahunch kar kanon ko chhooney lagega.''"
"6533","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse pahley jis cheez ka faisla logon ke darmyan hoga wo nahaq khoon ke badla ka hoga.''"
"6534","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne apne kisi bhai par zulm kya ho to usey chahiye ke us se (is duniya mein) maaf kara ley. isliye ke aakhirat mein rupye-paisey nahi hongey. us se pahley ( maaf kara ley (ke uske bhai ke liye uski nekiyon mein se haq dilaya jaeyga aur agar uske paas nekiyan na hongi to us ( mazloom ( bhai ki buraaiyaan is par daal di jaaeingii.''"
"6535","us aayat ke barey main (ونزعنا ما في صدورهم من غل‏) kahaa ke ham se Saeed ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne bayan kya, unse abu-mutwakkil naajii ne aur unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momineen jahannam se chhutkara pa jaeinge lekin dozakh aur jannat ke darmyan aik pul par unhein rok liya jaeyga aur phir aik ke doosrey par un mazaalim ka badla liya jaeyga jo duniya mein unke darmyan aapas mein huey they aur jab kaat-chhaant kar li jaeygi aur safaaii ho jaeygi tab unhein jannat mein dakhil honey ki ijazat milegii. to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! jannatiyon mein se har koi jannat main apne ghar ko duniya ke apne ghar ke muqable mein zyada behtar tareeqey par pehchan lega.''"
"6536","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jiske hisab mein khod-kured ki gaee usko zaroor azab hoga.'' wo kehti hain ke maine arz kya : kya Allah Taala ka ye farman nahi hai) فسوف يحاسب حسابا يسيرا‏ ( '' phir an-qareeb unse halka hisab liya jaaeyga.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is se murad sirf peshii hai."
"6537","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs se bhi qiyamat ke din hisab liya gaya to wo halaak hua. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya Allah Taala ne khud nahi farmaya hai) فأما من أوتي كتابه بيمينه * فسوف يحاسب حسابا يسيرا‏ (ke '' to jiska naamaae-aa'maal iske daain hath mein diya gaya to an-qareeb us se aik aasan hisab liya jaaeyga.'' is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to sirf peshii hogi. ( Allah rabbul-izzat ke kehney ka matlab ye hai ke) qiyamat ke din jiske bhi hisab mein khod kured ki gaee usko azab yaqeeni hoga."
"6538","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke qiyamat ke din kaafir ko laya jaeyga aur us se puchha jaeyga ke tumhara kya khayal hai ke agar zameen bhar kar tumharey paas sona ho to kya sab ko (apni nijat ke liye) fidye mein de doge? wo kahega ke haan, to us waqt us se kaha jaeyga ke tum se us se bahut aasan cheez ka (duniyaa mein) mutalba kya gaya tha."
"6539","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein har-har fard se Allah Taala qiyamat ke din is tarah kalam karega ke Allah ke aur bandey ke darmyan koi tarjuman nahi hoga. phir wo dekhega to iske aagey koi cheez nazar nahi aaeygi. phir wo apne samney dekhega aur uske samney aag hogi. to tum mein se jo shakhs bhi chahey ke wo aag se bachey to wo Allah ki raah mein khair khairat karta rahe, chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey ke zariey hi mumkin ho."
"6540","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se bacho, phir aap ne chehra pher liya, phir farmaya ke jahannam se bacho aur phir uske baad chehra Mubarak pher liya, phir farmaya jahannam se bacho . teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa hi kya. ham ne us se ye khayal kya ke aap jahannam dekh rahe hain. phir farmaya ke jahannam se bacho chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey hi ke zariey ho sakey aur jisey ye bhi na miley to usey ( logon mein) kisi achi baat kehney ke zariey se hi (jahannam se) bchney ki koshish karni chahiye"
"6541","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere samney ummatein pesh ki gain kisi Nabi ke sath poori ummat guzri , kisi Nabi ke sath chand aadmi guzrey, kisi Nabi ke sath das aadmi guzrey , kisi Nabi ke sath panch aadmi guzrey aur koi Nabi tanha guzraa. phir maine dekha to insanon ki aik bahut badi jamat door se nazar aai. maine Jibraeel se puchha kya ye meri ummat hai? unhon-ne kaha nahi balke ufuq ki taraf dekho . maine dekha to aik bahut zabardast jamat dikhai di. farmaya ke ye hai aap ki ummat aur ye jo aagey-aagey 70 hazaar ki tadaad hai un logon se hisab na liya jaeyga aur na un par azab hoga. maine puchha : aisa kyon hoga? unhon-ne kaha ke uski wjah ye hai ke ye log dagh nahi lagwaatey they. dam-jhaad nahi karwatey they, shagoon nahi letey they, apne rab par bharosa kartey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) uth kar badhey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi un logon mein kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai ke aey Allah ! unhein bhi unmein se kar de. iske baad aik aur sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya ke mere liye bhi dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha usmein tum se aagey badh gaey."
"6542","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ki aik jamat jannat mein dakhil hogi jiski tadaad 70 hazaar hogi. unke chehrey is tarah roshan hongey jaisey chaudahween raat ka chaand roshan hota hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par ukaasha-bin-Mohsin Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey, apni dhaarii daar kamlii jo unke jism par thi, uthatey huey arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allaah! unhein bhi unmein se kar de. iske baad aik aur sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! dua kijiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha tum se aagey badh gaey."
"6543","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein meri ummat ke 70 hazaar ya saat (7) laakh ( rawi ko unmein se kisi aik tadaad mein shak tha) aadmi is tarah dakhil hongey ke kuchh log kuchh ko pakdey huey hongey aur is tarah unmein ke agley pichhley sab jannat mein dakhil ho jaeinge aur unke chehrey chaudahwiin raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hongey.''"
"6544","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab ahle-jannat jannat main aur ahale-jahannam jahannam mein dakhil ho jaeinge to aik awaz dene wala unke darmyan khada ho kar pukaarega ke aey jahannam waalo! ab tumhen maut nahi aaeygii aur aey jannat waalo! tumhen bhi maut nahi aaeygii balke hamesha yahin rehna hoga.''"
"6545","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahle-jannat se kaha jaeyga ke aey ahle-jannat ! hamesha (tumhein yahin ( rehna hai, tumhen maut nahi aaeygii aur ahale-dozakh se kaha jaeyga ke aey dozakh waalo! hamesha (tum ko yahin ( rehna hai, tum ko maut nahi aaeygi.''"
"6546","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke maine jannat mein jhank kar dekha to wahan rehney waley aksar ghareeb log they aur maine jahannam mein jhank kar dekha (shab meraaj mein) to wahan auratein thin."
"6547","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main jannat ke darwazey par khada hua to wahan aksar dakhil hone-waale mohtaaj log they aur mehnat mazdoorii karne waley they aur maaldaar log aik taraf rokey gaey hain, unka hisab leney ke liye baqi hai aur jo log dozakhi they wo to dozakh ke liye bhej diye gaey aur maine jahannam ke darwazey par khadey ho kar dekha to usmein aksar dakhil honey wali auratein thiin.''"
"6548","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab ahle-jannat jannat mein chaley jaeinge aur ahale-dozakh dozakh mein chaley jaeinge to maut ko laya jaeyga aur usey jannat aur dozakh ke darmyan rakh kar zabah kar diya jaeyga phir aik awaz dene wala awaz dega ke aey jannat waalo! tumhen ab maut nahi aaeygii aur aey dozakh waalo! tumhen bhi ab maut nahi aaeygi. is baat se jannati aur zyada khush ho jaeinge aur jahannami aur zyada ghamgeen ho jaaengey.''"
"6549","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ahle-jannat se farmaeyga ke aey jannat waalo! jannati jawab dengey ham hazir hain aey hamarey parwardigaar! teri khush-naseebi hasil karne ke liye. Allah Taala poochhega kya ab tum log khush huey ? wo kahengey ab bhi bhala ham razi na hongey kyonke ab to , tu ney hamein wo sab kuchh de diya jo apni makhlooq ke kisi aadmi ko nahi diya. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke main tumhen is se bhi behtar cheez doonga . jannati kahengey aey rab! is se behtar aur kya cheez hogi ? Allah Taala farmaeyga ke ab main tumharey liye apni raza mandi ko hamesha ke liye daaimii kar doonga yani iske baad kabhi tum par naraz nahi hoonga."
"6550","Haarisa-bin-Suraaqa (Raziallahu anhu) badr ki ladai mein Shahid ho gaey. wo us waqt nau-umr they, to unki walida Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaein aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aapko malum hai ke Harisa se mujhey kitni mohabbat thi, (aap mujhey bataaein) agar wo jannat mein hai to main sabr kar loongii aur sabr par sawab ki ummeedwaar rahoongii aur agar koi aur baat hai to aap dekhengey ke main uske liye kya karti hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afsos kya tum paagal ho gaee ho? jannat aik hi nahi hai, bahut si jannatein hain aur wo ( Harisa ( jannatul-firdaus mein hai."
"6551","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kaafir ke donon shaanon ke darmyan tez chalney waley ke liye teen din ki masafat ka fasla hoga.''"
"6552","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hai jiske saaye mein sawar 100 saal tak chalney ke baad bhi usey tay nahi kar sakega. ''"
"6553","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hoga jiske saaye mein umda aur tez raftaar ghodey par Sawar shakhs 100 saal tak chalta rahega aur phir bhi usey tay na kar sakega. ''"
"6554","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri ummat mein 70 hazaar ya saat (7) laakh aadmi jannat mein jaengey. '' rawi ko shak hua ke Sehal se kon si tadaad bayan hui thi, '' (wo jannat mein is tarah dakhil hongey ke) wo aik doosrey ko thaamey huey hongey. unka pahlaa abhi andar dakhil na honey paaeyga ke jab tak aakhiri bhi dakhil na ho jaey. unke chehrey chaudahwiin raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hongey.''"
"6555","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat waley (apne uper ke darjon ke) baalaakhaanon ko is tarah dekhengey jaisey tum aasman mein sitaron ko dekhtey ho.''"
"6556","aur is mein wo us lafz ka izafa kartey they ke ''jaisey tum mashriqii aur maghribii kinaron mein doobtey sitaron ko dekhtey ho. ''"
"6557","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala qiyamat ke din dozakh ke sabse kam azab paaney waley se poochhega agar tumhen poori zameen ki saari cheezein muyassar hon to kya tum unko fidye mein (is azab se nijat paaney ke liye) de doge, wo kahega ke haan! Allah Taala farmaeyga ke maine tum se us se bhi Sehal cheez ka us waqt mutalba kya tha jab tum Adam (Alaihissalam) ki peeth mein they ke mere sath kisi ko Sharik na karna lekin tum ne ( tauheed ka ( inkar kya aur na maanaa aakhir shirk hi kya.''"
"6558","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kuchh log dozakh se shafaat ke zariey niklengey maano ke) ثعارير ( hon.'' Hammad kehtey hain ke maine Amr-bin-Dinar se puchha ke) ثعارير ( kya cheez hai? unhon-ne kaha ke is se murad chhoti kakdiyaan hain aur hua ye tha ke aakhir umr mein Amr-bin-Dinar ke daant gir gaey they. Hammad kehtey hain ke maine Amr-bin-Dinar se kaha : aey abu-Muhammad ! (ye Amr-bin-Dinar ki kunniyat hai) kya aap ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se ye suna hai? unhon-ne bayan kya ke yahan maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se shafaat ke zariey log niklengey? unhon-ne kaha haan beshak suna hai."
"6559","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik jamat jahannam se niklegii iske baad ke jahannam ki aag ne unko jalaa daala hoga aur phir wo jannat mein dakhil hongey. ahle-jannat unko (jahannamiyon) ke naam se yad karengey. ''"
"6560","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab ahle-jannat jannat main aur ahale-jahannam jahannam mein dakhil ho chukengey to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke jiske dil mein raai ke daane ke barabar bhi eman ho to usey dozakh se nikaal lo. us waqt aisey log nikaley jaeinge aur wo us waqt jal kar koiley ki tarah ho gaey hongey. iske baad unhein ''nehre-hayaat'' (zindagii bakhsh dariya ( mein daala jaeyga us waqt wo is tarah taro-taazaa ho jaeinge jis tarah sailaab ki jagah par koode-karkat ka daana (usi raat ya din mein) ug aata hai ya rawi ne kaha ( حميل السيل (ke bajaey) ( حمية السيل ( kaha hai. yani jahan sailaab ka zor ho aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ne dekha nahi ke us daane se zard rang ka liptaa hua baa-raunaq paudaa ugtaa hai."
"6561","maine Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din azab ke eitibaar se sabse kam wo shakhs hoga jiske donon qadmon ke nichey aag ka angaara rakha jaeyga aur uski wjah se uska dimagh khol raha hoga."
"6562","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din dozkhiyon mein azab ke eitibaar se sabse halka azab paaney wala wo shakhs hoga jiske donon pairon ke nichey 2 angaarey rakh diye jaeinge jinki wjah se uska dimagh khol raha hoga jis tarah handi aur ketli josh khaatii hai."
"6563","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jahannam ka zikr kya aur rukh pher liya aur us se panah maangii. phir jahannam ka zikr kya aur rukh pher liya aur us se panah mangi . iske baad farmaya ke dozakh se bacho sadqa de kar chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey hi ke zariey ho sakey, jisey ye bhi na miley usey chahiye ke achi baat keh kar."
"6564","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aap ke chacha abu-Taalib ka zikr kya gaya tha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mumkin hai qiyamat ke din meri shafaat unke kaam aa jaey aur unhein jahannam mein takhnon tak rakha jaey jis se unka bheja kholtaa rahega."
"6565","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala qiyamat ke din logon ko jama karega. us waqt log kahengey ke agar ham apne rab ke huzoor mein kisi ki shafaat ley jayen to nafa bakhsh Sabit ho sakti hai. mumkin hai ham apni is haalat se nijat pa jaaein. chunanche log Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur arz karengey aap hi wo buzurg Nabi hain jinhein Allah Taala ne apne hath se banaya aur aap ke andar apni chhipaaii hui Rooh phoonki aur farishton ko hukm diya to unhon-ne aapko sajda kya, aap hamarey rab ke huzoor mein hamari shafaat karein. wo kahengey ke main to is laaiq nahi hun, phir wo apni khata ko yad karengey aur kahengey ke Nuh ke paas jao, wo sabse pahley rasool hain jinhein Allah Taala ne bhejaa. log Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey lekin wo bhi yahi jawab dengey ke main us laaiq nahi hun. wo apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahein ke tum Ibrahim ke paas jao jinhein Allah Taala ne apna khaleel banaya tha. log unke paas aaeingey lekin ye bhi yahi kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahengey ke tum log Musa ke paas jao jin se Allah Taala ne kalam kya tha. log Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jaeinge lekin wo bhi yahi jawab dengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahengey ke Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao . log Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jaaeinge, lekin ye bhi kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao kyonke unke tamam agley pichhley gunah maaf kar diye gaey hain. chunanche log mere paas aaeingey. us waqt main apne rab se ( shafaat ki) ijazat chaahoonga aur sajde mein gir jaaunga . Allah Taala jitni der tak chaahega mujhey sajde mein rehney dega. phir kaha jaeyga ke apna sar utha lo, maango diya jaeyga, kaho suna jaeyga, shafaat karo, shafaat qabool ki jaeygi. main apne rab ki us waqt aisi hamd bayan karunga ke jo Allah Taala mujhey sikhaaeyga. phir shafaat karunga aur mere liye had muqarrar kar di jaeygi aur main logon ko jahannam se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil kar doonga aur isi tarah sajde mein gir jaunga, teesri ya chothi martaba jahannam mein sirf wahi log baqi reh jaeinge jinhein Quran ne rokaa hai (yani jinke jahannam mein hamesha rehney ka zikr Quran mein sarahat ke sath hai) Qatada (Rahmatullahi-alaih) is mauqe par kaha kartey ke is se wo log murad hain jin par jahannam mein hamesha rehna wajib ho gaya hai."
"6566","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik jamat jahannam se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki shafaat ki wjah se nikley gii aur jannat mein dakhil hogi jinko ( jahannamii) ke naam se pukara jaaeyga.''"
"6567","Haarisa-bin-Suraaqa bin-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin. Harisa badr ki ladai mein aik naa-maaloom teer lag janey ki wjah se Shahid ho gaey they aur unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! aapko malum hai ke Harisa se mujhey kitni mohabbat thi, agar wo jannat mein hai to is par main nahiin ro'ongii, warna aap dekhengey ke main kya karti hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke bewaqoof ho gaee ho, kya koi jannat aik hi hai, jannatein to bahut si hain aur Harisa ''firdause-aa'laa'' ( jannat ke oonchey darjey ( mein hai."
"6568","Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye aik subah ya aik Sham safar karna duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se badh kar hai aur jannat mein tumhari aik kamaan ke barabar jagah ya aik qadam ke faasley ke barabar jagah duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se behtar hai aur agar jannat ki aurton mein se koi aurat poori zameen ki taraf jhank kar dekh ley to aasman se lekar zameen tak munawwar kar de aur un tamam ko khushbu se bhar de aur uska dupatta ( duniya aur jo kuch usmein hai) se badh kar hai."
"6569","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein jo bhi dakhil hoga usey uska jahannam ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaeyga ke agar nafarmani ki hoti (to wahan usey jagah miltii (taake wo aur zyada shukr karey aur jo bhi jahannam mein dakhil hoga usey uska jannat ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaeyga ke agar achchhey amal kiye hotey (to wahan jagah miltii) taake uske liye hasarat w afsos ka baais ho."
"6570","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya : ya Rasulullah! qiyamat ke din aap ki shafaat ki khush-naseebi sabse zyada kon hasil karega? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey abu-Huraira! mera bhi khayal tha ke ye hadis tum se pahley aur koi mujh se nahi poochhega, kyonke hadis ke leney ke liye mein tumhari bahut zyada hirs dekha karta hun. qiyamat ke din meri shafaat ki khush-naseebi sabse zyada usey hasil hogi jisne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( Khuloos dil se kahaa."
"6571","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main khub janta hun ke ahaley jahannam mein se kon sabse aakhir mein wahan se niklega aur ahle-jannat mein kon sabse aakhir mein usmein dakhil hoga. aik shakhs jahannam se ghutnon ke bal ghisattey huey niklega aur Allah Taala us se kahega ke jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao, wo jannat ke paas aayega lekin usey aisa malum hoga ke jannat bhari hui hai. chunanche wo wapas aayega aur arz karega : aey mere rab! maine jannat ko bharaa hua paya , Allah Taala phir us se kahega ke jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao. wo phir aayega lekin usey aisa malum hoga ke jannat bhari hui hai wo wapas lautey ga aur arz karega ke aey mere rab! maine jannat ko bharaa hua paya. Allah Taala farmaeyga jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao tumhen duniya aur us se dus guna diya jata hai ya (Allah taala farmaeyga ke) tumhen duniya ke dus guna diya jata hai. wo shakhs kahega to mera mazaaq banata hai halanke to shehanshaah hai. maine dekha ke is baat par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans diye aur aap ke aagey ke dandaaney Mubarak zahir ho gaey aur kaha jata hai ke wo jannat ka sabse kam darjey wala shakhs hoga."
"6572","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : kya aap ne abu-Taalib ko koi nafa pahunchaya ?"
"6573","kuchh logon ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya qiyamat ke din ham apne rab ko dekh sakengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya suraj ko dekhney main tumhen koi dushwari hoti hai jabke is par koi badal (abr) wghaira na ho? sahaba ne arz kya : nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya jab koi badal na ho to tumhen chaudahween raat ke chaand ko dekhney mein koi dushwari hoti hai? sahaba ne arz kya : nahi ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum Allah Taala ko isi tarah qiyamat ke din dekhogey. Allah Taala logon ko jama karega aur kahega ke tum mein se jo shakhs jis cheez ki poojaa-paat kya karta tha wo usi ke peechhey lag jaey. chunanche jo log suraj ki parastish kya kartey they wo uske peechhey lag jaeinge aur jo log chaand ki puja kartey they wo uske peechhey ho lengey. jo log buton ki parastish kartey they wo unke peechhey lag jaeinge aur aakhir mein ye ummat baqi reh jaeygi aur is mein munaafeqeen ki jamat bhi hogi, us waqt Allah Taala unke samney is sura mein aayega jis ko wo pehchantey na hongey aur kahega ke main tumhara rab hun. log kahengey tujh se Allah ki panaah. ham apni jagah par us waqt tak raheingey jab tak ke hamara parwardigar hamarey samney na aaey. jab hamara rab hamarey paas aayega to ham usey pehchan lengey (kyonke wo hashr mein aik baar usko pahley dekh chukey hongey) phir haq taala is sura mein aayega jis ko wo pehchantey hongey aur unse kaha jaeyga (aao mere sath ho lo) main tumhara rab hun ! log kahengey ke to hamara rab hai, phir usi ke peechhey ho jaeinge aur jahannam par pul bana diya jaeyga Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main sabse pahlaa shakhs hunga jo us pul ko paar karunga aur us din rasulon ki dua ye hogi ke aey Allah ! mujh ko salamat rakhiyo . aey Allah ! mujh ko salamat rakhiyo aur wahan Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah aankdey hongey. tum ne Sadan ke kaantey dekhey hain? sahaba kiram ne arz kya ji haan dekhey hain ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo phir Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah hongey albatta uski lambai chaudai Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta. wo logon ko unke aamaal ke mutabiq uchak lengey aur is tarah unmein se kuchh to apne aa'mal ki wjah se halaak ho jaeinge aur kuchh ka aa'mal raai ke daney ke barabar hoga, phir wo nijat pa jaeyga aakhir jab Allah Taala apne bandon ke darmyan faisley se farigh ho jaeyga aur jahannam se unhein nikaalnaa chaahega jinhein nikalney ki uski marzi hogi. yani wo jinhoney kalima (لا إله إلا الله) ki gawahi di hogi aur Allah Taala farishton ko hukm dega ke wo aisey logon ko jahannam se nikaaley. Farishtey unhein sajdon ke nishanat se pehchan lengey kyonke Allah Taala ne aag par haram kar diya hai ke wo ibne-Aadam ke jism mein sajdon ke nishan ko khaaey . chunanche Farishtey un logon ko nikaley gey . ye jal kar koiley ho chukey hongey phir un par pani chhidkaa jaeyga jisey (ماء الحياة) zindagi bakhshney wala pani kehtey hain. us waqt wo is tarah taro-taazaa ho jaeinge jaisey sailaab ke baad zarkhaiz (زرخیز) zameen mein daana ug aata hai. aik aisa shakhs baqi reh jaeyga jiska chehra jahannam ki taraf hoga aur wo kahega aey mere rab! uski badboo ne mujhey pareshan kar diya hai aur uski lipat ne mujhey jhulsaa diya hai aur uski tezi ne mujhey jalaa daala hai, zara mera munh aag ki taraf se dusri taraf pher de. wo isi tarah Allah se dua karta rahega. aakhir Allah Taala farmaeyga agar main tera ye mutalba pura kar dun to kahin to koi dusri cheez maangnii shuru na kar de. wo shakhs arz karega nahi, teri izzat ki qism ! main iske siwa koi dusri cheez nahi maangon ga . chunanche iska chehra jahannam ki taraf se dusri taraf pher diya jaeyga ab iske baad wo kahega . aey mere rab! mujhey jannat ke darwazey ke qareeb kar dijiye. Allah Taala farmaeyga kya tu ney abhi yaqin nahi dilaya tha ke iske siwa aur koi cheez nahi maangey ga. afsos ! aey ibne-Aadam ! to bahut zyada wada khilaf hai. phir wo barabar isi tarah dua karta rahega to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke agar main teri ye dua qabool kar loon to to phir iske ilawa kuchh aur cheez maangney lagey ga. wo shakhs kahega nahi, teri izzat ki qism ! main iske siwa aur koi cheez tujh se nahi maangon ga aur wo Allah se ahad w paiman karega ke iske siwa ab koi aur cheez nahi maangey ga. chunanche Allah Taala usey jannat ke darwazey ke qareeb kar dega. jab wo jannat ke andar ki ne'maton ko dekhega to jitni der tak Allah Taala chaahega wo shakhs khamosh rahega, phir kahega aey mere rab ! mujhey jannat mein dakhil kar de. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke kya tu ney ye yaqin nahi dilaya tha ke ab to iske siwa koi cheez nahi maangey ga. aey ibne-Aadam ! afsos, to kitna wada khilaf hai. wo shakhs arz karega aey mere rab! mujhey apni makhlooq ka sabse bad-bakht banda na banaa. wo barabar dua karta rahega yahan tak ke Allah Taala hans dega. jab Allah hans dega to us shakhs ko jannat mein dakhil honey ki ijazat mil jaeygi. jab wo andar chala jaeyga to us se kaha jaeyga ke falan cheez ki khahish kar chunanche wo uski khahish karega. phir us se kaha jaeyga ke falan cheez ki khahish karo, chunanche wo phir khahish karega yahan tak ke uski khuwaahishaat khatm ho jaeyngi to Allah Taala ki taraf se kaha jaeyga ke teri ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur itni hi zyada ne'matein aur di jati hain. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi sanad se kaha ke ye shakhs jannat mein sabse aakhir mein dakhil honey wala hoga."
"6574","Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) bhi us waqt Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath baithey huey they aur unhon-ne unki kisi baat par aetraz nahi kya lekin jab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) hadis ke us tukdey tak pahunchey ke tumhari ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur itni hi aur zyada ne'matein di jati hain to Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhari ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur us se dus guna aur zyada ne'matein di jati hain. aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi maine yun hi suna hai, ye sab cheezein aur itni hi aur."
"6575","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ke main tum se pahley hi hauz par maujood rahoonga."
"6576","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main apne hauz par tum se pahley hi maujood rahunga aur tum mein se kuchh log mere samney laey jaeinge phir unhein mere samney se hata diya jaeyga to main kahunga ke aey mere rab! ye mere sathi hain lekin mujh se kaha jaeyga ke aap nahi jantey ke unhon-ne aap ke baad Deen mein kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Aasim ne abu-Wayeil se ki, unse Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaayaa."
"6577","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tumhaarey samney hi mera hauz hoga wo itna bada hai jitna (mulk Sham ke do gaanv) jarbaa aur azroohaa ke darmyan fasla hai.''"
"6578","kausar se murad bahut zyada bhalai (khair kaseer) hai jo Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di hai. abu-Bashar ne bayan kya ke maine Saeed-bin-Jubair se kaha ke kuchh logon ka khayal hai ke kausar jannat mein aik nehar hai to unhon-ne kaha ke jo nehar jannat mein hai wo bhi us khair (bhalaaii) ka aik hissa hai jo Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di hai."
"6579","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meraa hauz aik mahiney ki doori ke barabar hoga. uska pani doodh se zyada safaid aur uski khushbu mushk se zyada achi hogi aur uske koozey (gharey) aasmaan ke sitaron ki tadaad ke barabar hongey. jo shakhs usmein se aik martaba pi lega wo phir kabhi bhi (maidaan mahshar mein) piyaasaa na hoga.''"
"6580","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere hauz ki lambai itni hogi jitni iila aur Yaman aur Shahar san'aa ke darmyan ki lambai hai. aur wahan itni badi tadaad mein pyaley hongey jitney aasman ke sitaron ki tadaad hai.''"
"6581","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke main jannat mein chal raha tha ke main aik nehar par pahuncha iske donon kinaron par khauldaar motiyon ke gunbad baney huey they. maine puchha : Jibraeel ! ye kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ye kausar hai jo aap ke rab ne aapko diya hai. maine dekha ke uski khushbu ya mitti tez mushk jaisi thi. rawi ko shak tha."
"6582","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere kuchh sathi hauz par mere samney laey jaeinge aur main unhein pehchan loonga lekin phir wo mere samney se hata diye jaengey. main is par kahunga ke ye to mere sathi hain. lekin mujh se kaha jaeyga ke aapko malum nahi ke unhon-ne aap ke baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thiin.''"
"6583","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main apne hauz kausar par tum se pahley maujood rahoonga. jo shakhs bhi meri taraf se guzrey ga wo iska pani piey ga aur jo iska pani piey ga wo phir kabhi piyaasaa nahi hoga aur wahan kuchh aisey log bhi aaeingey jinhein main pahchaanoon ga aur wo mujhey pahchaanein gey lekin phir unhein mere samney se hata diya jaaeyga.''"
"6584","mein gawahi deta hun ke maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis isi tarah suni thi aur wo us hadis mein kuchh zyadti ke sath bayan kartey they. (yani ye ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaaengey ke) main kahunga ke ye to mujh mein se hain) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha jaeyga ke aapko nahi malum ke unhon-ne aap ke baad Deen mein kya- kya nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin. is par main kahunga ke door hon wo shakhs jisne mere baad Deen mein tabdili kar li thii."
"6585","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din mere sahaba mein se aik jamat mujh par pesh ki jaeygi. phir wo hauz se door kar diye jaengey. mein arz karunga : aey mere rab! ye to mere sahaba hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein ghad li thin ? ye log (deen se) ultey paanw wapas lot gaey they.'' (doosri sanad) Shuaib-bin-abii-Hamza ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se (فيجلون) (bajaaey (فيحلؤون)) ke bayan kartey they. aur Aqeel (فيحلؤون) bayan kartey they aur Zubaidi ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne, unse Muhammad-bin Ali ne, unse Ubaidullah bin abi Raafe ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6586","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' hauz par mere sahaba ki aik jamat aaeygii . phir unhein us se door kar diya jaeyga mein arz karunga mere rab! ye to mere sahaba hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin, ye ultey paon (Islam se) wapas lot gaey they.''"
"6587","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''main (hauz par) khada hunga ke aik jamat mere samney aaeygii aur jab main unhein pehchan loonga to aik shakhs (farishta) mere aur unke darmyan se niklega aur unse kahega ke idhar aao . main kahunga ke kidhar ? wo kahega ke Allah ki qism jahannam ki taraf. main kahunga ke unke halaat kya hain? wo kahega ke ye log aap ke baad ultey paon (deen se) wapas lot gaey they. phir aik aur giroh mere samney aayega aur jab main unhein bhi pehchan loonga to aik shakhs (farishta) mere aur unke darmyan mein se niklega aur unse kahega ke idhar aao . main poochhoon ga ke kahaan? to wo kahega, Allah ki qism ! jahannam ki taraf. main kahunga ke unke halaat kya hain? farishta kahega ke ye log aap ke baad ultey paon wapas lot gaey they. main samajhta hun ke un girohon mein se aik aadmi bhi nahi bachchey ga. un sab ko dozakh mein ley jaengey."
"6588","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere ghar aur mere member ke darmyan ki jagah ka jannat ke baaghon mein se aik baagh hai aur mera member mere hauz par hai."
"6589","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main hauz par tum se pahley maujood hunga ."
"6590","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur shohdaa Uhud ke liye is tarah dua ki jis tarah maiyat ke liye janazey mein dua ki jati hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par tashrif laey aur farmaya logo ! main tum se aagey jaaunga aur tum par gawah rahunga aur main Allah ki qism apne hauz ki taraf us waqt bhi dekh raha hun aur mujhey zameen ke khazaanon ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain ya farmaya ke zameen ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain. Allah ki qism ! main tumharey barey mein is baat se nahi darta ke tum mere baad shirk karogey, albatta us se darta hun ke tum duniya ke laalach mein pad kar aik doosrey se hasad karne lago gey ."
"6591","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hauz ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke (wo itna bada hai) jitni Madina aur san'aa ke darmyan doori hai."
"6592","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad suna, usmein itna zyada hai ke aap ka hauz itna lamba hoga jitni san'aa aur Madina ke darmyan doori hai. is par mustaurid ne kaha : kya aap ne bartanon wali riwayat nahi sunii? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. mustaurid ne kaha ke ke usmein bartan (peeney ke) is tarah nazar aaeingey jis tarah aasman mein sitaarey nazar aatey hain."
"6593","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main hauz par maujood rahunga aur dekhunga ke tum mein se kon mere paas aata hai. phir kuchh logon ko mujh se alag kar diya jaeyga mein arz karunga ke aey mere rab! ye to mere hi aadmi hain aur meri ummat ke log hain. mujh se kaha jaeyga ke tumhen malum bhi hai unhon-ne tumharey baad kya kaam kiye they? Allah ki qism ye musalsal ultey paon laut'tey rahe. (deen Islam se phir gaey) ibne-abi-Mulaika (jo ke ye hadis Asma se riwayat farmatey hain) kaha kartey they ke aey Allah ! ham is baat se teri panah maangtey hain ke ham ultey paon (deen se) lot jayen ya apne Deen ke barey mein fitna mein daal diye jaaein. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke sura mominoon mein jo Allah Taala ka farman hai) أعقابكم تنكصو‏) iska mana bhi yahi hai ke tum Deen se apni eidiyon ke bal ultey phir gaey they yani Islam se murtad ho gaey they."
"6594","ham ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan sunaya aur aap sachchon ke sachey they aur aap ki sachchai ki zabardast gawahi di gaee. farmaya ke tum mein se har shakhs pahley apni maa ke pet mein chalis (40) din tak nutfaa hi rakha jata hai. phir itni hi muddat main ( علقة ( yani khoon ki phutkii banta hai phir itney hi arse main ( مضغة ( (yani gosht ka lothdaa ( phir char maah baad Allah Taala aik farishta bhejta hai aur uske barey mein) maa ke pet hi mein) char baton ke likhney ka hukm diya jata hai. uski rozii ka, uski maut ka, iska ke wo bad-bakht hai ya nek bakht. to Allah ki qasam, tum mein se aik shakhs dozakh walon ke se kaam karta rehta hai aur jab uske aur dozakh ke darmyan sirf aik baalisht ka fasla ya aik hath ka fasla baqi reh jata hai to uski taqdeer is par ghalib aati hai aur wo jannat walon ke se kaam karne lagta hai aur jannat mein jata hai. isi tarah aik shakhs jannat walon ke se kaam karta rehta hai aur jab uske aur jannat ke darmyan aik hath ka fasla baqi reh jata hai to uski taqdeer is par ghalib aati hai aur wo dozakh walon ke kaam karne lagta hai aur dozakh mein jata hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) kehtey hain ke Aadam-bin-abii-Ayaas ne apni riwayat mein yun kaha ke jab aik hath ka fasla reh jata hai."
"6595","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne maa k pet par aik farishta muqarrar kar diya hai aur wo kehta rehta hai ke aey rab! ye ( نطفة ( qarar paya hai. aey rab! ab ( علقة ( yani jama hua khoon bin gaya hai. aey rab! ab ( مضغة‏ . Mina ( ) gosht ka lothdaa (bin gaya hai. phir jab Allah Taala chahta hai ke uski paidaaish poori karey to wo poochhta hai aey rab ladka hai ya ladki ? nek hai ya bura ? uski rozii kya hogi ? uski maut Kab hogi ? isi tarah ye sab baatein maa ke pet hi mein likh di jati hain, duniya mein usi ke mutabiq zahir hota hai."
"6596","aik sahib ne (yani khud unhon-ne) arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya jannat ke log jahannamiyon mein se pahchaaney ja chukey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''haan'' unhon-ne kaha ke phir amal karne waley kyon amal karein? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har shakhs wahi amal karta hai jiske liye wo paida kya gaya hai ya jiske liye usey sahoolat di gaee hai."
"6597","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrekeen ki aulad ke barey mein sawal kya gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ko khub malum hai ke wo ( badey ho kar) kya amal kartey."
"6598","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mushrekeen ki aulad ke mutaalliq puchha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai ke wo kya amal kartey."
"6599","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi bachcha aisa nahi hai jo fitrat par na paida hota ho. lekin uske waalidain usey Yahudi ya nasrani bana detey hain jaisa ke tumharey janwaron ke bachchey paida hotey hain. kya unmein koi kaan kata paida hota hai? wo to tum hi uska kaan kaat detey ho."
"6600","sahaba ne arz kya : phir ya Rasulullah ! us bachchey ke mutaalliq kya khayal hai jo bachpan hi mein mar gaya ho? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai ke wo ( bada ho kar) kya amal karta."
"6601","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi aurat apni kisi ( deenii ( behan ki talaaq ka mutalba ( shauhar se) na karey ke uske ghar ko apne hi liye khas kar lena chaahey. balke usey nikah (doosri aurat ki maujoodgii mein bhi) kar lena chahiye kyonke usey utnaa hi milega jitna uske muqaddar mein hoga."
"6602","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki saahibzaadiyon mein se aik ka bulaawaa aaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein Sad , Ubai-bin-Kab aur Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they. bulaney waley ne aa kar kaha ke unka bachcha (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka nawaasaa) jaan nikalney ki haalat mein hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kelha bheja ke Allah hi ka hai jo wo leta hai, isliye wo sabr karein aur Allah se ajr ki ummeed rakhein."
"6603","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baithey huey they ke qabila Ansar ka aik aadmi aaya aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham laundiyon se ham-bistarii kartey hain aur maal se mohabbat kartey hain. aap ka azl ke barey mein kya khayal hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha tum aisa kartey ho, tumharey liye kuchh qabahat nahi agar tum aisa na karo, kyonke jis jaan ki bhi paidaaish Allah ne likh di hai wo zaroor paida ho kar rahegi ."
"6604","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein aik khutba diya aur qiyamat tak koi ( deeni ( cheez aisi nahi chhodi jiska bayan na kya ho, jisey yad rakhna tha us ne yad rakha aur jisey bhoolnaa tha wo bhool gaya, jab main unki koi cheez dekhta hun jisey main bhool chuka hun to is tarah usey pehchan leta hun jis tarah wo shakhs jiski koi cheez gum ho gaee ho ke jab wo usey dekhta hai to fauran pehchan leta hai."
"6605","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath baithey huey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik lakdi thi jis se aap zameen kured rahe they aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (usi beech mein) farmaya ke tum mein se har shakhs ka jahannam ka ya jannat ka thikana likha ja chuka hai, aik musalman ne is par arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! phir kyon na ham is par bharosa kar lein ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi amal karo kyonke har shakhs (apni taqdeer ke mutabiq ( amal ki aasani paata hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us aayat ki tilawat ki) فأما من أعطى واتقى‏ ( to jisne Allah ki raah mein diya aur taqwa ikhtiyar kya. . . الخ ."
"6606","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar ki ladai mein maujood they, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ke barey mein jo aap ke sath Sharik jihad tha aur Islam ka dawedar tha farmaya ke ye jahannami hai. jab jang honey lagi to us shakhs ne bahut jam kar ladai mein hissey liya aur bahut zyada zakhmi ho gaya phir bhi wo Sabit qadam raha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik sahabi ne aa kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah! us shakhs ke barey mein aapko malum hai jiske barey mein abhi aap ne farmaya tha ke wo jahannami hai wo to Allah ke rastey mein bahut jam kar lada hai aur bahut zyada zakhmi ho gaya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ab bhi yahi farmaya ke wo jahannami hai. mumkin tha ke kuchh musalman shubeh mein pad jatey lekin is arse mein us shakhs ne zakhmon ko bardasht na kartey huey apna tarkash khola aur is mein se aik teer nikal kar apne aapko zabah kar liya. phir bahut se musalman Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein daudtey huey pahunchey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Allah Taala ne aap ki baat sach kar dikhai . us shakhs ne apne aapko halaak karke apni jaan khud hi khatm kar dali . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us mauqe par farmaya ke aey Bilal ! utho aur logon mein elaan kar do ke jannat mein sirf momin hi dakhil hoga aur ye ke Allah Taala is Deen ki khidmat w madad be-deen aadmi se bhi karaataa hai."
"6772","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab bhi zina karne wala zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, jab bhi koi sharab peeney wala sharab peetaa hai to wo momin nahi rehta, jab bhi koi chori karne wala chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, jab bhi koi lotney wala laut'taa hai ke log nazrein utha utha kar usey dekhney lagtey hain to wo momin nahi rahtaa. ''aur ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, unse Saeed-bin-Musaiyab aur abu-Salma ne bayan kya unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah siwa lafz (نهبة‏) ke."
"6773","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sharab peeney par chhadi aur jootey se maara tha aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne chalis (40) kode maarey."
"6774","Nuaimaan ya ibne-Nuaimaan ko sharab ke nashe mein laya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghar mein maujood logon ko hukm diya ke unhein maarein, unhon-ne maaraa, Aqba kehtey hain main bhi un logon mein tha jinhoney usko jooton se maaraa."
"6775","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Nuaimaan ya ibne- Nuaimaan ko laya gaya, wo nashe mein tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ye na-gawar guzra aur aap ne ghar mein maujood logon ko hukm diya ke unhein maarein. chunanche logon ne unhein lakdi aur jooton se maara aur main bhi un logon mein tha jinhoney usey maara tha."
"6776","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sharab peeney par chhadi aur jooton se maara tha aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne chalis (40) (40 ( kode lagwaaey they."
"6777","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik shakhs ko laya gaya jo sharab piye huey tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya usey maaro, Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke ham mein kuchh wo they jinhoney usey hath se maaraa, kuchh ne jootey se maara aur kuchh ne apne kapdey se maaraa. jab mar chukey to kisi ne kaha ke Allah tujhey ruswa kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah ke jumley na kaho, iske maamle mein shaitan ki madad na kar."
"6778","main nahi pasand karunga ke had mein kisi ko aisi saza dun ke wo mar jaey aur phir mujhey iska ranj ho, siwa shraabii ke ke agar wo mar jaey to main uski diyat ada kar doonga kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski koi had muqarrar nahi ki thi."
"6779","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aur phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke shuruati daure-khilaafat mein sharab peeney wala hamarey paas laya jata to ham apne haath, jootey aur chaadrein lekar khadey ho jatey (aur usey maartey) aakhir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne aakhiri daure-khilaafat mein sharab peeney walon ko chalis (40) kode maarey aur jab un logon ne mazeed sarkashi ki aur fisq w fujoor kya to 80 kode maarey ."
"6780","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein aik shakhs, jiska naam Abdullah tha aur) himaar (ke laqab se pukaarey jatey they, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hansaatey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein sharab peeney par maara tha to unhein aik din laya gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye hukm diya aur unhein maara gaya. haaziriin mein aik sahib ne kaha : Allah is par laanat karey ! kitni martaba kaha ja chuka hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par laanat na karo Allah ki qism maine iske mutaalliq yahi jana hai ke ye Allah aur uske rasool se mohabbat karta hai."
"6781","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik shakhs nashe mein laya gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein maarney ka hukm diya. ham mein se kuchh ne unhein hath se maaraa, kuchh ne jootey se maara aur kuchh ne kapdey se maaraa. jab mar chukey to aik shakhs ne kaha, kya ho gaya usey ? Allah usey ruswa kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne bhai ke khilaf shaitan ki madad na karo."
"6782","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab zina karne wala zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta aur isi tarah jab chor chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rahtaa.''"
"6783","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne chor par laanat bheji ke aik andaa churaataa hai aur uska hath kaat liya jata hai, aik rassii churaataa hai uska hath kaat liya jata hai. Aamash ne kaha ke log khayal kartey they ke andey se murad lohey ka andaa hai aur rassii se murad aisi rassii samajhtey they jo kai dirham ki ho."
"6784","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aik majlis mein baithey they, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujh se ahad karo Allah ke sath koi Sharik nahi thahraaogey, chori nahi karogey aur zina nahi karogey aur aap ne ye aayat poori padhi '' to tum mein se jo shakhs is ahad ko pura karega uska sawab Allah ke yahan hai aur jo shakhs unmein se ghalati kar guzra aur is par usey saza hui to wo uska kaffara hai aur jo shakhs unmein se koi ghalati kar guzra aur Allah Taala ne uski parda poshii kar di to agar Allah chaahega to usey maaf kar dega aur agar chaahega to is par azab dega.''"
"6785","Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par farmaya ''haan tum log kis cheez ko sabse zyada hurmat wali samajhtey ho? '' logon ne kaha ke apne isi maheene ko. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''haan, kis Shahar ko tum sabse zyada hurmat wala samajhtey ho?'' logon ne jawab diya ke apne isi Shahar ko . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''haan, kis din ko tum sabse zyada hurmat wala khayal kartey ho? '' logon ne kaha ke apne isi din ko . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ab farmaya '' phir bila shubah Allah ne tumharey khoon , tumharey maal aur tumhari izzaton ko hurmat wala qarar diya hai, siwa iske haq ke, jaisa ke is din ki hurmat is Shahar aur is maheene mein hai. haan ! kya maine tumhen pahuncha diyaa.'' teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur har martaba sahaba ne jawab diya ke ji haan , pahuncha diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' afsos mere baad tum kaafir na bin jana ke aik doosrey ki gardan maarney lago.''"
"6786","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab bhi 2 chizon mein se aik ke ikhtiyar karne ka hukm diya gaya to aap ne unmein se aasan hi ko pasand kya, basharte ke usmein gunah ka koi pahlu na ho, agar usmein gunah ka koi pahlu hota to aap us se sabse zyada door hotey. Allah ki qism ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi apne zaatii maamle mein kisi se badla nahi liya, albatta jab Allah ki hurmaton ko todaa jata to aap Allah ke liye badla letey they."
"6787","Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik aurat ki (jis par qurbani ka janwar muqaddima honey wala tha) sifarish ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum se pahley ke log isliye halaak ho gaey ke wo kamzoron par to had qaaim kartey aur buland martaba logon ko chhod detey they. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. agar Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne bhi) chori ( ki hoti to main uska bhi hath kaat leta ."
"6788","aik makhzumi aurat ka mamla jisne chori ki thi, Quraish ke logon ke liye ahmiyat ikhtiyar kar gaya aur unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is maamle mein kon baat kar sakta hai Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwaa, jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bahut piyarey hain aur koi aap se sifarish ki himmat nahi kar sakta ? chunanche Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kya tum Allah ki hadon mein sifarish karne aaey ho.'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur khutba diya aur farmaya ''aey logo! tum se pahley ke log isliye gumrah ho gaey ke jab unmein koi bada aadmi chori karta to usey chhod detey lekin agar kamzor chori karta to is par had qaaim kartey they aur Allah ki qasam! agar Fatima binte-Muhammad ne bhi chori ki hoti to Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska hath zaroor kaat daaltey."
"6789","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chauthaaii Dinar ya us se zyada par hath kaat liya jaaeyga.'' is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Abdur-Rehman bin Khalid Zohri ke bhatijey aur Mamar ne Zohri ke waaste se ki."
"6790","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' chor ka hath aik chothai Dinar par kaat liya jaaeyga.''"
"6791","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' chothai Dinar par hath kaataa jaaeyga.''"
"6792","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein chor ka hath baghair lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ya aam dhaal ki chori par hi kaataa jata tha. ham se Usman ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Humaid-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan ne bayan kya, unse Hisham ne bayan kya, unse unke walid ne, unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne isi tarah ( bayan kya ( ."
"6793","chor ka hath lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ya aam dhaal ki qeemat se kam par nahi kaataa jata tha. ye donon dhaal qeemat se miltii thin. uski riwayat Wakee aur ibne-Idrees ne Hisham ke waastey se ki, unse unke walid ne mursalan riwayat kya."
"6794","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein chor ka hath dhaal ki qeemat se kam par nahi kaataa jata tha. lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ho ya aam dhaal, ye donon cheezein qeemat wali thin."
"6795","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6796","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal ki chori par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6797","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6798","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik chor ka hath aik dhaal par kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi, is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin Ishaq ne ki aur Leis ne bayan kya ke mujh se Naafe ne ( ثمنه (ke bajaey) lafz ( قيمته ( kaha,"
"6799","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne chor par laanat ki hai ke aik andaa churaataa hai aur iska hath kaataa jata hai, aik rassii churaataa hai aur uska hath kaataa jata hai."
"6800","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aurat ka hath katwaayaa. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke wo aurat baad mein bhi aati thi aur main uski zarooratein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney rakhti thi, us aurat ne tauba kar li thi aur Hasan tauba ka saboot diya tha."
"6801","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik jamat ke sath bait ki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke main tum se ahad leta hun ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraaogey, tum chori nahi karogey, apni aulad ki jaan nahi logey , apne dil se ghad kar kisi par tohmat nahi lagaaogey aur nek kaamon mein meri nafarmani na karogey. to tum mein se jo koi waadey pura karega uska sawab Allah ke uper lazim hai aur jo koi unmein se kuchh ghalati kar guzrega aur duniya mein hi usey uski saza mil jaeygi to ye uska kaffara hogi aur usey paak karne wali hogi aur jiski ghalati ko Allah chipa lega to uska mamla Allah ke sath hai, chahey to usey azab de aur chahey to uski maghfirat kar de. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke hath katney ke baad agar chor ne tauba kar li to uski gawahi qabool hogi. yahi haal har us shakhs ka hai jis par had jari ki gaee ho ke agar wo tauba kar lega to uski gawahi qabool ki jaeygi."
"6802","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas qabila ukul ke chand log aaey aur Islam qabool kya lekin Madina ki aab w hua unhein muwafiq nahi aai (unke pet phool gaey ( to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke sadqe ke oonton ke rewad mein jayen aur unka peshab aur doodh mila kar piein. unhon-ne iske mutabiq amal kya aur tandurust ho gaey lekin iske baad wo murtad ho gaey aur un oonton ke charwaahon ko qatl karke oont hankaa ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki talash mein sawar bhejey aur unhein pakad ke laya gaya phir unke hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unki aankhen phod di gain (kyonke unhon-ne Islami charwaahey ke sath aisa hi bartaw kya tha) aur unke zakhmon par dagh nahi lagwaayaa gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"6803","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Urainiyon ke) hath paon ( katwaa diye lekin un par dagh nahi lagwaayaa , yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"6804","qabila ukul ke kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas 6 hijri mein aaey aur ye log masjid ke saaybaan mein thahrey . Madina Munawra ki aab w hua unhein muwafiq nahi aai. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hamarey liye doodh kahin se muhaiya kara dein, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to mere paas nahi hai. albatta tum log hamarey oonton mein chaley jao . chunanche wo aaey aur unka doodh aur peshab piyaa aur sihat mand ho kar motey taazey ho gaey. phir unhon-ne charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko hankaa ley gaey. itney main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas faryaadii pahuncha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki talash mein sawar bhejey. abhi dhoop zyada phailii bhi nahi thi ke unhein pakad kar laya gaya phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se salaaiyaan garm ki gain aur unki aankhon mein pher di gain aur unke hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unke ( zakhm se khoon ko rokney ke liye) unhein daaghaa bhi nahi gaya. iske baad wo Harra (Madina ki pathreelii zameen ( mein daal diye gaey, wo pani maangtey they lekin unhein pani nahi diya gaya. yahan tak ke wo mar gaey. abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke ye is wjah se kya gaya tha ke unhon-ne chori ki thi, qatl kya tha aur Allah aur uske rasool se ghaddaaraana ladai ladii thi."
"6805","qabila ukul ya Uraina ke chand log main samajhta hun ukul ka lafz kaha, Madina aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye doodh dene wali oontniyon ka intizam kar diya aur farmaya ke wo oonton ke galle mein jayen aur unka peshab aur doodh piein. chunanche unhon-ne piyaa aur jab wo tandurust ho gaey to charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko hankaa ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ye khabar subah ke waqt pahunchi to aap ne unke peechhey sawar daudaaey. abhi dhoop zyada phailii bhi nahi thi ke wo pakad kar laey gaey. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se unke bhi hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unki bhi aankhon mein silai pher di gaee aur unhein Harra mein daal diya gaya. wo pani maangtey they lekin unhein pani nahi diya jata tha. abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke ye wo log they jinhoney chori ki thi, qatl kya tha, eman ke baad kufr ikhtiyar kya tha aur Allah aur uske rasool se ghaddaaraana ladai ladii thi."
"6806","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' saat (7) aadmi aisey hain jinhein Allah Taala qiyamat ke din apne arsh ke nichey saaya dega jabke uske arsh ke saaye ke siwa aur koi saaya nahi hoga. aadil haakim, naujawaan jisne Allah ki ibadat mein jawaanii paaii, aisa shakhs jisne Allah ko tanhai mein yad kya aur uski aankhon se aansu nikal padey, wo shakhs jiska dil masjid mein laga rehta hai, wo aadmi jo Allah ke liye mohabbat kartey hain, wo shakhs jisey kisi buland martaba aur khoobsurat aurat ne apni taraf bulaya aur us ne jawab diya ke main Allah se darta hun aur wo shakhs jisne itna posheeda sadqa kya ke uske baaein hath ko bhi pata na chal saka ke daain ne kitna aur kya sadqa kya hai.''"
"6807","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne mujhey apne donon paon ke darmyan yani ( sharmgah ( ki aur apne donon jabdon ke darmyan (yani zaban ( ki zamaanat de di to main usey jannat mein janey ka bharosa dilata hoon.''"
"6808","main tum se aik aisi hadis bayan karunga ke mere baad koi usey nahi bayan karega. maine ye hadis Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni hai. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye kehtey suna ke qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim nahi hogi ya yun farmaya ke qiyamat ki nishaniyon mein se ye hai ke ilm Deen duniya se uth jaeyga aur jahaalat phail jaeygi, sharab kasrat se pi janey lagegii aur zina phail jaeyga mard kam ho jaeinge aur aurton ki kasarat hogi. haalat yahan tak pahunch jaeygi ke pachaas aurton par aik hi khabar leney wala mard reh jaeyga"
"6809","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''banda jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta . banda jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta aur banda jab sharab peetaa hai to wo momin nahi rehta aur jab wo qatl nahaq karta hai to wo momin nahi rahtaa. Ikrima ne kaha ke maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke eman us se kis tarah nikal liya jata hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo is tarah aur us waqt aap ne apni ungliyon ko doosrey hath ki ungliyon mein daal kar phir alag kar liya phir agar wo tauba kar leta hai to eman uske paas lot aata hai, is tarah aur aap ne apni ungliyon ko doosrey hath ki ungliyon mein dala."
"6810","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''zinaa karne wala jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, wo chor jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, shraabii jab sharab peetaa hai to wo momin nahi rehta . phir un sab aadmiyon ke liye tauba ka darwaza bahar-haal khula hua hai.''"
"6811","maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! kon sa gunah sabse bada hai. farmaya ye ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik banaao, halanke usi ne tumhen paida kya hai. maine puchha : iske ba'd? farmaya ye ke tum apni aulad ko us  khatrey (خطرے) se mar dalo ke wo tumharey khaney main tumharey sath Sharik hogi. maine puchha : iske ba'd? farmaya ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo, Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Sufiyan ne bayan kya, unse vaasiil (واصل) ne bayan kya, unse abu-Waeil ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! phir usi hadis ki tarah bayan kya. Amr ne kaha ke phir maine is hadis ka zikr Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi se kya aur unhon-ne ham se ye hadis Sufiyan soury se bayan ki, unse Aa'mash, Mansoor aur vaasiil (واصل) ne, unseunse abu-Waeil (ابوائل) ne aur unse abu-maisraa (ابومیسرہ) ne. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne kaha ke tum is sanad ko janey bhi do."
"6812","jab unhon-ne Juma ke din aurat ko rajm (sangsaar) kya to kaha ke maine iska rajm (sangsaar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat ke mutabiq kya hai."
"6813","kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, maine puchha : sura Noor se pahley ya iske ba'd? kaha ke ye mujhey malum nahi (naa-maaloom baat ke liye laa-ilmii zahir kar dena kar dena bhi durust hai)."
"6814","qabila Aslam ke aik sahib Maaiz naam ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey aur kaha ke maine zina kya hai. phir unhon-ne apne zina ka char martaba iqrar kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm diya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya, wo shadi shuda they."
"6816","rajm (sangsaar) karne walon mein, main bhi tha ham ne unhein aabadi se bahar eidgaah ke paas rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhag padey lekin ham ne unhein Harra ke paas pakda aur rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6817","Sad-bin-abi-Waqas aur abd-bin-Zam'a (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapas mein (eik bachchey Abdur-Rehman naam ke mein) ikhtilaf kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''abd-bin-Zam'a ! bachcha to ley-ley bachcha usi ko milega jiski jouroo ya londi ke pet se wo paida hua aur Sauda ! tum us se parda kya karo.'' imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Quteba ne Leis se is zyada ke sath bayan kya ke zaanii ke hissey mein patthar ki saza hai."
"6818","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ladkaa usi ko milta hai jiski jouroo ya londi ke pet se hua ho aur haram kaar ke liye sirf patthar hain.''"
"6819","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik Yahudi mard aur aik Yahudi aurat ko laya gaya, jinhoney zina kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha ke tumhari kitab Taurait mein uski saza kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey ulma ne (uskii sazaa) chehrey ko siyah karna aur gadhey par ulta sawar karna tajwiz ki hui hai. is par Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! unse Taurait mangwaaiye. jab Taurait laai gaee to unmein se aik ne rajm (sangsaar) wali aayat par apna hath rakh liya aur us se aagey aur peechhey ki aayatein padhney laga. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha ke apna hath hataao (aur jab us ne apna hath hataya to) aayat rajm (sangsaar) uske hath ke nichey thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya gaya. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unhein balaat (masjide-Nabawi ke qareeb aik jagah ( mein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya. maine dekha ke Yahudi aurat ko mard bachaney ke liye is par jhuk-jhuk padta tha."
"6820","qabila Aslam ke aik sahib (maaiz bin Maalik) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur zina ka iqrar kya. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf se apna munh pher liya. phir jab unhon-ne char martaba apne liye gawahi di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha kya tum deewaaney ho gaey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. phir aap ne puchha kya tumhara nikah ho chuka hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan. chunanche aap ke hukm se unhein eidgaah mein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya. jab un par patthar padey to wo bhag padey lekin unhein pakad liya gaya aur rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke haq mein kalima khair farmaya aur unka janaaza ada kya aur unki tareef ki jiske wo mustahiq they."
"6821","aik sahib ne Ramazan main apni biwi se ham-bistarii kar li aur phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska hukm puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tumharey paas koi ghulam hai? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya do mahiney rozey rakhney ki tum mein taqat nahi ? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par kaha ke phir sath (60) mohtajon ko khana khilaao ."
"6822","aik sahib Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas masjid mein aaey aur arz kya main to dozakh ka mustahiq ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya baat huii? kaha ke maine apni biwi se Ramazan mein hambistari kar li hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse kaha ke phir sadqa kar. unhon-ne kaha ke mere paas kuchh bhi nahi. phir wo baith gaya aur uske baad aik sahib gadhaa haanktey laey jis par khaney ki cheez rakhi thi. Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya ke mujhey malum nahi ke wo kya cheez thi. (doosri riwayat mein yun hai ke khajoor ladi hui thi) usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya ja raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke aag mein jalney waley sahib kahan hain? wo sahib boley ke main hazir hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey ley aur sadqa kar de. unhon-ne puchha kya apne se zyada mohtaaj ko dun? mere ghar walon ke liye to khud koi khaney ki cheez nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum hi kha lo. Abdullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke pehlii hadis zyada waazeh hai jis main (أطعم أهلك) ke alfaz hain."
"6823","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas tha ke aik sahib Ka'b-bin-Amr aaey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah! mujh par had (sharaii sazaa) wajib ho gaee hai. aap mujh par had jari keejiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se kuchh nahi poochha. bayan kya ke phir Namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur un sahib ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhi. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padh chukey to wo phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aa kar khadey ho gaey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! mujh par had wajib ho gaee hai aap kitabullah ke hukm ke mutabiq mujh par had jari kijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke kya tum ne abhi hamarey sath Namaz nahi padhi hai. unhon-ne kaha ke ji . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ne tera gunah maaf kar diya ya farmaya ke teri ghalati ya had (muaaf kar dii)."
"6824","jab Maaiz bin Malik Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke ghaaliban tu ney bosa diya hoga ya ishara kya hoga ya dekha hoga. unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya kya phir tu ney ham-bistarii hi kar li hai? is martaba aap ne ishaaroo se kaam nahi liya. bayan kya ke iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm diya."
"6825","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik sahib aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt masjid mein baithey huey they. unhon-ne awaz di ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. khud apne mutaalliq wo keh rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse apna munh pher liya. lekin wo sahib bhi hat kar usi taraf khadey ho gaey jidhar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir apna munh pher liya aur wo bhi dobara us taraf aagey jidhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur is tarah jab us ne char martaba apne gunah ka iqrar kar liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko bulaya aur puchha kya tum paagal (پاگل) ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tum shadi shuda ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur rajm (sangsaar) kar do."
"6828","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas they, to aik sahib khadey huey aur kaha, main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karein. is par uska muqabil bhi khada ho gaya aur wo pahley se zyada samajhdaar tha, phir usne kaha ke waqei aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah se hi faisla kijiye aur mujhey bhi guftgu ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, us shakhs ne kaha ke mera betaa us shakhs ke yahan mazdoorii par kaam karta tha phir us ne uski aurat se zina kar liya, maine iske fidya mein usey sou (100) bakri aur aik khaadim diya, phir maine kuchh ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal Shahar Badr honey ki had wajib hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumharey darmyan kitabullah hi ke mutabiq faisla karunga . sou (100) bakriyaan aur khaadim tumhen wapas hongey aur tumharey betey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye usey shahar badar kya jaeyga aur aey unnais ! subah ko uski aurat ke paas jana agar wo (zinaa ka ( iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche wo subah ko uske paas gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya aur unhon-ne rajm (sangsaar) kar diya. Ali-bin-Abdullaah-madeenii kehtey hain maine Sufiyaan-bin-Ueina se puchha jis shakhs ka betaa tha us ne yun nahi kaha ke un aalimon ne mujh se bayan kya ke terey betey par rajm (sangsaar) hai. unhon-ne kaha ke mujh ko usmein shak hai ke Zohri se maine suna hai ya nahi, isliye maine usko kabhi bayan kya, kabhi nahi bayan kya, balkii khaamoosh raha."
"6829","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, main darta hun ke kahin zyada waqt guzar jaey aur koi shakhs ye kehney lagey ke kitabullah main to rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm hamein kahin nahi milta aur is tarah wo Allah ke aik fareeza ko chhod kar gumrah hon jisey Allah Taala ne nazil kya hai. aagah ho jao ke rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm us shakhs ke liye farz hai jisne shadi shuda honey ke bawajud zina kya ho basharte ke sahi sharaee gawaahiyon se Sabit ho jaey ya hamal ho ya koi khud iqrar kare. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine isi tarah yad kya tha aagah ho jao ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha aur aap ke baad ham ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha."
"6830","mein kai muhajireen ko) Quran Majeed ( padhaayaa karta tha. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unmein se aik they. abhi main Mina mein unke makan par tha aur wo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke aakhiri Haj main (23 hijri ( unke sath they ke wo mere paas lot kar aaey aur kaha ke kash! tum us shakhs ko dekhtey jo aaj ameerul-momineen ke paas aaya tha. usne kaha ke aey ameerul-momineen! kya aap falan sahib se ye poochh-gachh karengey jo ye kehtey hain ke agar umr ka intiqal ho gaya to main falan sahib Talha bin Ubaidullah se bait karunga kyonke Allah ki qism Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki baghair sochey samjhey bait to achcha ho gaee aur phir wo mukammal ho gaee thi. is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) bahut ghussa huey aur kaha, main inshaAllah Sham ke waqt logon se khitab karunga aur unhein un logon se daraaoonga jo zabardastii se dakhal dr-ma'qoolaat karna chahtey hain. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke is par maine arz kya : ya ameerul-momineen! aisa na kijiye . Haj ke mausam mein kam samjhii aur burey-bhaley har hi qism ke log jama hain aur jab aap khitab ke liye khadey hongey to aap ke qareeb yahi log zyada hongey aur mujhey dar hai ke aap khadey ho kar koi baat kahein aur wo charon taraf phail jaey, lekin phailaaney waley usey sahi taur par yad na rakh sakengey aur uske ghalat maana pehnaaney lagengey, isliye Madina Munawra pahunchne tak ka intizar kar lijiye kyonke wo hijrat aur sunnat ka maqam hai. wahan aapko khalis deeni samajh-boojh rakhney waley aur sharif log milengey, wahan aap jo kuchh kehna chahtey hain aitimad ke sath hi farma sakengey aur ilm waley aap ki baton ko yad bhi rakhengey aur jo sahi matlab hai wahi bayan karengey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha haan achchha Allah ki qism main Madina Munawra pahunchtey hi sabse pahley logon ko usi mazmoon ka khutba doonga . Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir ham Zil-Hijja ke maheene ke aakhir mein Madina Munawra pahunchey . Juma ke din suraj dhaltey hi ham ne (masjide-Nabawii) pahunchne mein jaldi ki aur maine dekha ke Saeed bin Zaid-bin-Amr-bin-Nufail mimber ki jad ke paas baithey huey they. main bhi unke paas baith gaya. mera takhna unke takhney se laga hua tha. thodi hi der mein umr (Raziallahu anhu) bhi bahar nikley, jab maine unhein aatey dekha to Saeed bin Zaid-bin-Amr-bin-Nufail (Raziallahu anhu) se maine kaha ke aaj umr (Raziallahu anhu) aisi baat kahengey jo unhon-ne us se pahley khaleefa banaey janey ke baad kabhi nahi kahi thi. lekin unhon-ne usko na maanaa aur kaha ke main to nahi samajhta ke aap koi aisi baat kahengey jo pahley kabhi nahi kahi thi. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) member par baithey aur jab muazzan azan de kar khamosh hua to aap khadey huey aur Allah Taala ki sana uski shaan ke mutabiq bayan karne ke baad farmaya : ammaa ba'd! aaj main tum se aik aisi baat kahunga jiska kehna meri taqdeer mein likha hua tha, mujh ko nahi malum ke shayad meri ye guftgu maut ke qareeb ki aakhiri guftgu ho. to jo koi usey samjhey aur mehfooz rakhey usey chahiye ke is baat ko us jagah tak pahuncha de jahan tak uski sawari usey ley ja sakti hai aur jisey khof ho ke usne baat nahi samjhii hai to uske liye jaaiz nahi hai ke meri taraf ghalat baat mansub kare. bila shubah Allah Taala ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko haq ke sath maboos kya aur aap par kitab nazil ki, kitabullah ki sura mein jo kuchh aap par nazil hua, unmein aayat rajm (sangsaar) bhi thi. ham ne usey padha tha samjha tha aur yad rakha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud (apne zamane mein) rajm (sangsaar) karaya. phir aap ke baad ham ne bhi rajm (sangsaar) kya lekin mujhey dar hai ke agar waqt yun hi aagey badhtaa raha to kahin koi ye na dawa kar baithey ke rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat ham kitabullah mein nahi patey aur is tarah wo us fareeze ko chhod kar gumrah hon jisey Allah Taala ne nazil kya tha. yaqinan rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm kitabullah se us shakhs ke liye Sabit hai jisne shadi honey ke baad zina kya ho. chahe mard hon ya auratein , basharte ke gawahi mukammal ho jaey ya hamal zahir ho ya wo khud iqrar kar ley phir kitabullah ki aayaton mein ham ye bhi padhtey they ke apne haqiqi bap daadon ke siwa dusron ki taraf apne aapko mansub na karo. kyonke ye tumhara kufr aur inkar hai ke tum apne asl bap daadon ke siwa dusron ki taraf apni nisbat karo. haan aur sun lo ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya tha ke meri tareef had se badha kar na karna jis tarah Esa ibne-Maryam (Alaihissalam) ki had se badha kar ta'reefein ki gain (unko Allah ko betaa bana diya gaya) balke ( mere liye sirf ye kaho ke) mein Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hun aur mujhey ye bhi malum hua hai ke tum mein se kisi ne yun kaha hai ke Allah ki qism agar umr ka intiqal ho gaya to main falan se bait karunga dekho tum mein se kisi ko ye dhokaa na ho ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki bait naagaah hui aur Allah ne naa-gahaanii bait mein jo burai hui hai us se tum ko bachaaey rakha uski wjah ye hui ke tum ko Allah Taala ne uske shar se mehfooz rakha aur tum mein koi shakhs aisa nahi jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jaisa muttaqii , khuda taras ho. tum mein kon hai jis se milney ke liye oont chillaey jatey hun. dekho khayal rakho koi shakhs kisi se baghair musalmanon ke salaah-mashware aur ittifaq aur ghalba raayon ke baghair bait na karey jo koi aisa karega uska nateeja yahi hoga ke bait karne wala aur bait leney wala donon apni jaan ganwaa dengey aur sun lo bila shubah jis waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ham sabse behtar they albatta Ansar ne hamari mukhalifat ki thi aur wo sab log Saqeefaa-banii-saaida mein jama ho gaey they. isi tarah Ali aur Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke sathiyon ne bhi hamari mukhalifat ki thi aur baqi muhajireen Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jama ho gaey they. us waqt maine Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aey Abu-Bakar ! hamein apne un Ansari bhaiyon ke paas ley chaliye . chunanche ham unse mulaqat ke irade se chal padey . jab ham unke qareeb pahunchey to hamari , unhein ke 2 nek logon se mulaqat hui aur unhon-ne ham se bayan kya ke Ansari aadmiyon ne ye baat thahraaii hai ke) Sad-bin-Ubada ko khaleefa banaaein) aur unhon-ne poochha. hazraat muhajireen aap log kahan ja rahe hain. ham ne kaha ke ham apne un Ansari bhaiyon ke paas ja rahe hain. unhon-ne kaha ke aap log hargiz wahan na jayen balke khud jo karna hai kar dalo lekin maine kaha ke b-khudaa ham zaroor jaengey. chunanche ham aagey badhey aur Ansar ke paas Saqeefaa-banii-saaida mein pahunchey majlis mein aik sahib (sardaar khazraj) chadar apne sarey jism par lapetey darmyan mein baithey they. maine puchha ke ye kon sahib hain to logon ne bataya ke Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) hain. maine puchha ke unhein kya ho gaya hai? logon ne bataya ke bukhar aa raha hai. phir hamarey thodi der tak baithney ke baad unke khateeb ne kalima shahadat padha aur Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef ki. phir kaha : ammaa ba'd! ham Allah ke Deen ke madadgaar ( Ansar (aur Islam ke lashkar hain aur tum aey giroh muhajireen ! kam tadaad mein ho. tumhari ye thodi si tadaad apni qaum Quraish se nikal kar ham logon mein aa rahe ho. tum log ye chahtey ho ke hamein jad se ukhaad dalo aur ham ko khilafat se mahroom karke aap khaleefa bin baitho, ye kabhi nahi ho sakta. jab wo khutba pura kar chukey to maine bolnaa chaha. maine aik umda taqreer apne zahan mein tarteeb de rakhi thi. meri badi khahish thi ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baat karne se pahley hi main usko shuru kar dun aur Ansar ki taqreer se jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghussa paida hua hai usko door kar dun jab maine baat karni chahi to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha zara thehro maine unko naraz karna bura jaanaa. aakhir unhon-ne hi taqreer shuru ki aur Allah ki qism ! wo mujh se zyada aqlmand aur mujh se zyada sanjeeda aur mateen they. maine jo taqreer apne dil mein soch li thi usmein se unhon-ne koi baat nahi chhodii. faurii taur par wahi kahi balke us se bhi behtar phir wo khamosh ho gaey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taqreer ka khulaasa ye tha ke Ansari bhaiyo ! tum ne jo apni fazeelat aur buzurgi bayan ki hai wo sab durust hai aur tum beshak uske haqdaar ho magar khilafat Quraish ke siwa aur kisi khandan walon ke liye nahi ho sakti . kyonke Quraish azrooye nasb aur azrooye khandan tamam Arab qaumon mein badh chadh kar hain ab tum log aisa karo ke un 2 aadmiyon mein se kisi se bait kar lo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mera aur abu-Ubaida bin-Jarraah ka hath thaamaa wo hamarey beech mein baithey huey they, is saari guftgu mein sirf yahi aik baat mujh se mere siwa hui. Allah ki qism main aagey kar diya jata aur be-gunaah meri gardan mar di jati to ye mujhey us se zyada pasand tha ke mujhey aik aisi qaum ka ameer banaya jata jis mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khud maujood hon. mera ab tak yahi khayal hai ye aur baat hai ke waqt par nafs mujhey bahkaa de aur main koi doosra khayal karun jo ab nahi karna. phir Ansar mein se aik kehney wala hubaab bin munzir yun kehney laga suno-suno main aik lakdi hun ke jis se oont apna badan ragad kar khujlii ki takleef rafa' kartey hain aur main wo baadh hun jo darakhton ke ird-gird hifazat ke liye lagai jati hai. main aik umda tadbeer bataataa hun aisa karo 2 khaleefa rahen (donon mil kar kaam karein) aik hamari qaum ka aur aik Quraish walon kaa. muhajireen qaum ka ab khub shor-ghul honey laga koi kuchh kehta koi kuchh kehta . main dar gaya ke kahin musalmanon mein phoot na pad jaey aakhir main keh utha abu-Bakar! apna hath badhaao, unhon-ne hath badhaya maine unse bait ki aur muhajireen jitney wahan maujood they unhon-ne bhi bait kar li phir ansaariyon ne bhi bait kar li (chalo jhagdaa tamam hua jo manzoor ilahi tha wahi zahir hua) iske baad ham Sad-bin-Ubada ki taraf badhey ( unhon-ne bait nahi ki) aik shakhs Ansar mein se kehney laga : bhaiyo ! bechaarey Sad-bin-Ubada ka tum ne khoon kar dala. maine kaha Allah uska khoon karega . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us khutbey mein ye bhi farmaya us waqt ham ko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat se zyada koi cheez zaroori malum nahi hoti kyonke ham ko dar paida hua kahin aisa na ho ham logon se juda rahen aur abhi unhon-ne kisi se bait na ki ho wo kisi aur shakhs se bait kar baithein tab 2 Suraton se khali nahi hota ya to ham bhi jabran usi se bait kar letey ya logon ki mukhalifat kartey to aapas mein fasaad paida hota ( phoot pad jati ( dekho phir yahi kehta hun jo shakhs kisi se bin sochey samjhey , bin salaah w mashwara bait kar ley to doosrey log bait karne waley ki pairwi na karey, na uski jis se bait ki gaee hai kyonke wo donon apni jaan ginwaaeingey."
"6832","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne jilaa watan kya tha phir yahi tariqa qaaim ho gaya."
"6833","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisey shakhs ke barey mein jisne zina kya tha aur wo ghair shadi shuda tha, had qaaim karne ke sath aik saal tak Shahar se bahar karne ka faisla kya tha."
"6834","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un mardon par laanat ki hai jo mukhannas bantey hain aur un aurton par laanat ki hai jo mard bantii hain aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein apne gharon se nikal do aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne falan ko ghar se nikala tha aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne falan ko nikala tha."
"6836","eik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par doosrey ne khadey ho kar kaha ke unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! unka kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karein, mera ladka unke yahan mazdoor tha aur phir us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga chunanche maine so bakriyon aur aik kaneez ka fidya diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unka khayal hai ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii lazimi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum donon ka faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. bakriyan aur kaneez tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii ki saza milegii aur Anees ! subah us aurat ke paas jao (aur agar wo iqrar karey to) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche unhon-ne usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. (wo aurat kahin aur jagah thi) aap ne usey rajm (sangsaar) karne ke liye Anees ko bheja usi se baab ka matlab nikla . qastalaanii ne kaha ke aap ne jo Anees ko fareeq saanii ki joru ke paas bheja wo zina ki had maarney ke liye nahi bheja kyonke zina ki had lagaaney ke liye tajassus karna ya dhoondhnaa bhi durust nahi hai agar koi khud aa kar bhi zina ka iqrar karey uske liye bhi chhaanbeen karna mustahab hai, yani yun kehna ke shayad tu ney bosa diya hoga ya chhuaa hoga balke aap ne Anees ko sirf isliye bheja ke us aurat ko khabar kar dein ke falan shakhs ne tujh par zina ki tohmat lagai hai. ab wo hade-qazaf ka mutalba karti hai ya maaf karti hai. jab Anees uske paas pahunchey to us aurat ne saaf taur par zina qabool kya. is qabool karney par Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko had lagai aur rajm (sangsaar) kya."
"6838","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us kaneez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jo ghair shadi shuda ho aur zina kara liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo zina kiraaey to usey kode maaro , agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro aur usey bech dalo chahe aik rassii hi qeemat mein miley. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey yaqin nahi ke teesri martaba ( kode lagaaney ke hukm (ke baad ye farmaya ya chothi martaba ke baad ."
"6839","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar kaneez zina kiraaey aur uska zina khul jaey to usey kode maarney chaahiyein lekin laanat malaamat na karni chahiye phir agar wo dobara zina karey to phir chahiye ke kode maarey lekin malaamat na karey phir agar teesri martaba zina kiraaey to bech de chahe baalon ki aik rassii hi qeemat par ho. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ismail bin Umayya ne Saeed se ki, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6840","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha, maine puchha sura Noor se pahley ya iske ba'd, unhon-ne batlaya ke mujhey malum nahi. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ali-bin-mus'hir, Khalid-bin-Abdullaah al-mahaarabi aur Ubaida-bin-Humaid ne Shebani se ki hai aur kuchh ne (sura Noor ke bajaey) sura Mayeda ka zikr kya hai lekin pehli riwayat sahi hai."
"6841","Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha ke unmein se aik mard aur aik aurat ne zinaakaarii ki hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha ke Taurait mein rajm (sangsaar) ke mutaalliq kya hukm hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham unhein ruswa kartey hain aur kode lagaatey hain. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke tum jhootey ho usmein rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm maujood hai. chunanche wo Taurait laey aur khola . lekin unke aik shakhs ne apna hath aayate-rajm (sangsaar) par rakh diya aur us se pahley aur baad ka hissa padh diya. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha ke apna hath uthaao. us ne apna hath uthaya to iske nichey rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat maujood thi. phir unhon-ne kaha : aey Muhammad! aap ne sach farmaya ke usmein rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat maujood hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur donon rajm (sangsaar) kiye gaey. maine dekha ke mard aurat ko pattharon se bachaney ki koshish main is par jhukaa raha tha."
"6843","2 aadmi apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur doosrey ne jo zyada samajhdaar they kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey arz karne ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, unhon-ne kaha ke mera betaa un sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. Malik ne bayan kya ke) Aseef ( mazdoor ko kehtey hain aur us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujh se kaha ke mere betey ki saza rajm (sangsaar) hai. chunanche maine iske fidye mein so bakriyan aur aik londi de di phir jab maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr karna hai. rajm (sangsaar) to sirf us aurat ko kya jaeyga isliye ke wo shadi shuda hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hain phir unke betey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kya aur Anees Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke us mazkura (uper zikr) aurat ke paas jayen agar wo iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar dein chunanche us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."
"6844","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tumhari wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur sab logon ko rukna padaa jabke yahan pani bhi nahi hai. chunanche wo mujh par sakht naraz huey aur apne hath se meri kokh mein mukkaa maarney lagey magar maine apne jism mein kisi qism ki harkat isliye nahi honey di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aaraam farma rahe they. phir Allah Taala ne tayammum ki aayat nazil ki."
"6845","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur zor se mere aik sakht ghoonsaa lagaya aur kaha tu ney aik haar ke liye sab logon ko rok diya. main us se marney ke qareeb ho gaee is qadr mujh ko dard hua lekin kya kar sakti thi kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sar Mubarak meri raan par tha. ( لكز (aur ( وكز (ke aik hi mana hain."
"6846","Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekh loon to seedhi talwaar ki dhaar se usey mar daalun . ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhen Sad ki ghairat par hairat hai. main unse bhi badh kar ghairat mand hun aur Allah mujh se bhi zyada ghairat mand hai."
"6847","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik dehati aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah! meri biwi ne kala ladka janaa hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poochha, tumharey paas oont hain? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha unke rang kaisey hain? unhon-ne kaha ke surkh . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha unmein koi khaakii rang ka bhi hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha phir ye kahan se aa gaya? unhon-ne kaha mera khayal hai ke kisi rag ne ye rang kheench liya jiski wjah se aisa oont paida hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aisa bhi mumkin hai ke terey betey ka rang bhi kisi rag ne kheench liya ho."
"6848","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ki hadon mein kisi muqarrara had ke siwa kisi aur saza mein das kode se zyada bataur saza na maarey jaaein. ''"
"6849","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ki tay ki hui sazaaon mein se se kisi had ke siwa mujrim ko das kode se zyada ki saza na di jaaey.''"
"6850","main Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ke paas betha hua tha ke Abdur-Rehman bin Jaabir aaey aur Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se bayan kya phir Sulaiman-bin-Yasar hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se Abdur-Rehman bin Jaabir ne bayan kya hai ke unse unke walid ne bayan kya aur unhon-ne abu-Barda Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hudood Allah main se kisi had ke siwa kisi saza mein das kode se zyada ki saza na do."
"6851","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wisaal (musalsal iftaar ke baghair kai din ke rozey rakhney ( se mana farmaya to kuchh sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap khud to wisaal kartey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kon mujh jaisa hai? mera to haal ye hai ke mujhey mera rab khilata hai aur pilaataa hai lekin wisaal karne se sahaba nahi rukey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sath aik din ke baad doosrey din ka wisaal kya phir iske baad logon ne chaand dekh liya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ( eid ka ( chaand na dikhai deta to main aur wisaal karta. ye aap ne tanbeeh ke taur par farmaya tha kyonke wo wisaal karne par israar kar rahey they. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Shuaib , Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Yunus ne Zohri se ki hai aur Abdur-Rehman bin Khalid Fahmii ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Shahab ne, unse Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kya."
"6852","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane main is par mar padtii ke jab ghalle ke dher yun hi khareedein, bin naapey aur toley usko usi jagah doosrey ke hath bech daalein haan wo ghalla utha kar apne thikaaney ley jayen phir bechein to kuchh saza na hoti."
"6853","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne zaatii maamle mein kabhi kisi se badla nahi liya haan jab Allah ki qaaim ki hui had ko todaa jata to aap phir badla letey they."
"6854","maine 2 liaan karne waley miyan biwi ko dekha tha. us waqt meri umr pandarah saal thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan judai kara di thi. shauhar ne kaha tha ke agar ab bhi main (apni biwi ko) apne sath rakhoon to iska matlab ye hai ke main jhoota hun. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine Zohri se ye riwayat mehfooz rakhi hai ke ''agar us aurat ke aisa bachcha paida hua to shauhar sachcha hai aur agar uske aisaa-aisaa bachcha paida hua jaisey chhipkalii hoti hai to shauhar jhoota hai.'' aur maine Zohri se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke us aurat ne us aadmi ke ham-shakl bachcha janaa jo meri tarah ka tha."
"6855","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne 2 liaan karne walon ka zikr kya to Abdullaah-bin-Shaddaad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye wahi thi jiske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi aurat ko bila gawahi rajm (sangsaar) kar sakta (to usey zaroor kartaa) Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi ye wo aurat thi jo ( fisq w fujoor ( zahir kya karti thi."
"6856","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein liaan ka zikr aaya to Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par aik baat kahi phir wo wapas aaey. iske baad unki qaum ke aik sahib ye shikayat lekar unke paas aaey ke unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath ghair mard ko dekha hai. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke main apni is baat ki wjah se aazmaish mein daala gaya hun. phir aap un sahib ko lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein tashrif laey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski itlaa di jis haalat mein unhon-ne apni biwi ko paya. wo sahib zard rang , kam gosht , seedhey baalon waley they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! us mamla ko zahir kar de. chunanche us aurat ke yahan usi shakhs ki shakl ka bachcha paida hua jiske mutaalliq shauhar ne kaha tha ke usey unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath dekha hai phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan liaan karaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se majlis mein aik sahib ne kaha ke ye wahi tha jiske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi ko bila gawahi ke rajm (sangsaar) kar sakta to usey rajm (sangsaar) karta. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi ye to wo aurat thi jo Islam laney ke baad buraaiyaan ea'laaniya karti thi."
"6857","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''saat (7) halaak karney waaley gunahon se bacho . sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! wo kya kya hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke sath shirk karnaa, jaadoo karnaa, nahaq kisi ki jaan lena jo Allah ne haram kya hai, sood khana , yateem ka maal khana , jang ke din peeth phernaa aur paak daman ghaafil momin aurton ko tohmat lagaanaa .''"
"6858","jisne apne ghulam par tohmat lagai halanke ghulam us tohmat se barii tha to qiyamat ke din usey kode lagaey jaeinge , siwa iske ke uski baat sahi ho."
"6860","eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha ke main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par fareeq mukhalif khada hua, ye zyada samajhdaar tha aur kaha ke unhon-ne sach kaha, hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kijiye aur ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ( guftgu ki) ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kahiye. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka inke yahan mazdoorii karta tha phir us ne inkii biwi ke sath zina kar liya. maine iske fidya mein aik so bakriyan aur aik khaadim diya phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza milnii chahiye aur iski biwi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq hi karunga. so bakriyan aur khaadim tumhen wapas milengey aur tumharey betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza di jaeygi aur aey Anees us aurat ke paas subah jana aur us se poochhna agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) karnaa, us aurat ne iqrar kar liya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."